    "id": "mukul975--anthropic-cybersecurity-skills--validating-tpm-measured-boot-attestation",
    "name": "validating-tpm-measured-boot-attestation",
    "description": "Verifies TPM 2.0 measured-boot integrity and remote attestation with tpm2-tools -- reading PCRs (tpm2_pcrread), replaying the boot event log, generating and checking signed quotes (tpm2_quote/tpm2_checkquote), and sealing secrets to a PCR policy. Use to confirm a system booted trusted firmware/kernel for Zero Trust device posture, detect boot-chain tampering via PCR drift, or build a golden-value baseline for fleet attestation.",
